WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.401
Living with MS: patient perspectives.

2
00:00:03.851 --> 00:00:08.367
Patients describe diagnosis, treatment decisions and daily life with MS.

3
00:00:08.817 --> 00:00:14.877
Diagnosis rests on clinical findings and MRI showing lesions disseminated in space and time.

4
00:00:15.327 --> 00:00:18.439
Early treatment reduces relapses and new lesions.

5
00:00:18.889 --> 00:00:21.431
Options range from moderate to high efficacy.

6
00:00:21.881 --> 00:00:27.152
Regular clinical review and MRI identify breakthrough activity and the need to escalate.
